e in this office and it is something  that they will truly appreciate number  seven on the list is a laser tape  measurer if you have no idea what a  laser tape measure is well you're  probably not an architect but every  architect needs one basically it's a  very simple tool you press one button  and it gives you a measurement it is  incredibly useful for anybody on site  all you need to do is go to your local  hardware store find a laser tape  measurer and pick up the best one you  can find now we're really getting pricey  so now I know you actually like this  person number eight on the list is the  one and only iPad Pro with the apple  pencil the iPad Pro paired with an apple  pencil is one of the best gifts you can  get to an architect because it allows  full flexibility in design Freedom  coordination office work basically  everything on the go it is my everyday  tool and it's something that I highly  recommend every architect have at their  disposal the last two on this list are  getting extremely pricey number nine is  a 3D printer now everybody's heard of 3D  printing but it continuously advances  every single year a good 3D printer is  able to create a series of 3D models for  Architects to explore their ideas and  one of the best things about a 3D  printer is you don't have to go and cut  hundreds of little shapes you can just  3D print this model overnight and  impress clients immediately so  personally I much prefer 3D printed  models over hand making models just  because of the time consuming nature of  the exercise now you've made it to  number 10 this is by far the most  expensive gift and by far the most  absurd gift you can get anybody so I  truly hope you really like this person  number 10 on this list is the Apple  Studio display it's the screen behind me  and it is screen in most of my tutorials  it is a screen of choice for Architects  for one very simple reason Architects  are often Drafting and designing in very  small details that means we're often  focusing on the smallest detail at the  smaller sizes on our screen if the  screen isn't clear if it isn't sharp  then you continuously get headaches  every single day so for me personally an  Apple Studio display provides you  longevity so you can work harder design  better and get less headaches it is an  extremely expensive gift it is an  Overkill in monitors but it is by far  crystal clear so that you'd never miss  even the finest lines anyway that is my  top 10 list of gifts for Architects  designers and students of the like if  you enjoyed this video make sure you  smash the Subscribe button down below if  you want to see more great architectural  content there's a playlist to the side  of me but that is all for me so like  always I'll see you next Monday
 

